    -l, --list            list tag names
    -n[<n>]               print <n> lines of each tag message
    -d, --delete          delete tags
    -v, --verify          verify tags

Tag creation options
    -a, --[no-]annotate   annotated tag, needs a message
    -m, --message <message>
